'''Qodzar of Qym''' (Bacha Qodzar Bylam Miham ish Zhifol; born DAY MONTH {{abbr|2408|2000 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}) is a member of the [[Qymish royal family]] and the reigning [[King of Qym]] since DAY MONTH {{abbr|2443|2029.46 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. He is the nephew of [[Bacha XVIII of Qym|King Bacha XVIII]], cousin of [[Bacha XIX of Qym|King Bacha XIX]], and son of [[Bacha XX of Qym|King Bacha XX]]. He is the first King of Qym to not use ''Bacha'' as his regal name. 

