==Personal life==
Qodzar is married to [[Najat Miritani]] since {{abbr|2438|2025 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. The couple have one child, [[Prince Bylam of Qym|Prince Bylam]], born in {{abbr|2439|2026 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. 

Being the same age, Qodzar was a close friend of his cousin, [[Mirmo ish Zhifol]], the former [[wikipedia:heir apparent|heir apparent]]. He openly supported his music career, unlike most of the [[Qymish royal family]]. 

